Free the ASAP player when ReadTag() cannot load a file.

Directory scans read tags of every file; each file ASAP rejected leaked an
ASAP player object.

Upstream: generic bug, suitable for xbmc/audiodecoder.asap.

--- a/src/ASAPCodec.cpp
+++ b/src/ASAPCodec.cpp
@@ -107,6 +107,7 @@
   // Now load the module
   if (!ASAP_Load(asap, toLoad.c_str(), data, len))
   {
+    ASAP_Delete(asap);
     delete[] data;
     return false;
   }
